     "id": "board-van",
     "title": "04｜肋溝與胸壁：VAN 和三層肋間肌",
     "html": "<div class=\"enrichment-label\">板書構想重繪＋教材核對</div><figure><a href=\"assets/board-3-van.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"放大：肋溝與胸壁：VAN 和三層肋間肌\"><img src=\"assets/board-3-van.svg\" alt=\"肋溝與胸壁：VAN 和三層肋間肌；胸壁剖面＋層次展開\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>視角：胸壁剖面＋層次展開。本部回看 09:00–14:30。依板書構想重繪／整合並核對教材，非逐筆摹寫或等比例；點圖可放大。</figcaption></figure><div class=\"table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"比較表，可左右捲動\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">讀圖重點</th><th scope=\"col\">教材核對／易錯處</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>VAN 由上到下；血管神經位於內層與最內層之間。</td><td>胸橫肌不等於整個胸壁所有最深層肌肉。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a href=\"#/subject/anatomy/chapter/bones3/topic/ribs-wall\">到對應主題頁看詳細表格與教材圖 →</a></p><p>本圖核對：<a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/7-4-the-thoracic-cage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S7</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK459153/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S43</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK538328/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S58</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK549847/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S59</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK544368/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S60</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK538321/?report=printable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S78</a></p>"
