     "id": "board-pudendal",
     "title": "03｜坐骨孔與梨狀肌：陰部神經繞行",
     "html": "<div class=\"enrichment-label\">板書構想重繪＋教材核對</div><figure><a href=\"assets/board-4-pudendal.svg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"放大：坐骨孔與梨狀肌：陰部神經繞行\"><img src=\"assets/board-4-pudendal.svg\" alt=\"坐骨孔與梨狀肌：陰部神經繞行；後外側通路展開\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>視角：後外側通路展開。本部回看 00:00–04:12。依板書構想重繪／整合並核對教材，非逐筆摹寫或等比例；點圖可放大。</figcaption></figure><div class=\"table-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"比較表，可左右捲動\" tabindex=\"0\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">讀圖重點</th><th scope=\"col\">教材核對／易錯處</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>大坐骨孔分梨狀肌上下；陰部神經繞坐骨棘後進小孔。</td><td>經小孔到會陰，不是回腹膜腔；陰部管與閉孔管不同。</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><a href=\"#/subject/anatomy/chapter/bones4/topic/pelvic-passages\">到對應主題頁看詳細表格與教材圖 →</a></p><p>本圖核對：<a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/8-3-the-pelvic-girdle-and-pelvis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S72</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK507801/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S108</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/books/NBK554736/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S114</a> · <a href=\"https://humananatomy.host.dartmouth.edu/BHA/public_html/part_3/chapter_14.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S125</a> · <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sites/books/NBK554736/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S75</a></p>"
